---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Shipping Information | MycoVerse Delivery">
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#3E2723] mb-4">Shipping & Delivery</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">Fast, safe, and reliable delivery guidelines.</p>

    <div class="bg-[#FDFBF7] p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#3E2723]/20 space-y-4 text-gray-700">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#3E2723]">Delivery Zones & Rates</h2>
      <p>We offer tailored delivery options depending on your selected zone during checkout. Costs and estimated times are clearly displayed before you complete your order.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#3E2723] pt-4">Handling & Processing</h2>
      <p>Orders are processed immediately once payment confirmation instructions are coordinated. Our team ensures all packages are securely and discreetly handled from our store to your door.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>